{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_027say0643_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_027say0643_1000_p", "source_sha256": "933a6cee6567abd77f636ce0da6760a51c9452e0d7e4a2e79b03731ae008ee2c", "ja": "（今日はグラビア雑誌のタイアップ企画の撮影。\n紗代子は冷凍たい焼きとのコラボCMにも出演する）", "zh": "（今天要拍摄平面杂志的联动企划。\n纱代子还要出演冷冻鲷鱼烧的联动广告）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_027say0643_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_027say0643_1001_027say", "source_sha256": "68501a7882f33b6d3ad85a82b45ef398eef1efa9cb14d9d6ed42aafe5f07e8db", "ja": "まさか、たい焼きのお仕事が来るなんて……！\n絶対にいいCMにしなきゃ！　よーし、頑張るぞー！", "zh": "没想到居然会接到鲷鱼烧的工作……！\n一定要拍出一支出色的广告！好——加油！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_027say0643_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_027say0643_1002_p", "source_sha256": "2b89fdbdbd83a94f427fc7357fc54b61d08fe097e21ea7b389ec885fe22f6b27", "ja": "お疲れさま、紗代子。\nずいぶん気合いが入ってるな。", "zh": "辛苦了，纱代子。\n你还真是干劲十足啊。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_027say0643_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_027say0643_1003_027say", "source_sha256": "38a9b4c78dbddd196ca88fd5693db812c5ddc68bceccd175b4a650cdbfca2f53", "ja": "当然です。こんな機会、なかなかないですから！\nあ、そうだ。相談したいことがあるんです。", "zh": "那是当然的。毕竟这种机会可不多得！\n啊，对了。我有件事想找您商量。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_027say0643_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_027say0643_1004_027say", "source_sha256": "71f467cb59b0b8efd27d15328ce67eebd7aa9240ec297a54a1da5f81585d6990", "ja": "今回のCM、私が悪魔になって、たい焼きを\n食べるように誘惑するっていう内容じゃないですか。", "zh": "这次的广告，不就是由我来扮演恶魔，诱惑别人吃鲷鱼烧吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_027say0643_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_027say0643_1005_027say", "source_sha256": "19747f468dd1bba14554b90534c6c9715fe3cfcbb299b50a507ae8221058612c", "ja": "なので、誘惑する方法をいくつか考えてきたんです。\nでも、どのプランがいいか迷ってて……。", "zh": "所以，我提前想了几个诱惑人的方法。\n不过，我还在犹豫哪个方案比较好……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_027say0643_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_027say0643_1006_p", "source_sha256": "f3d022ec9f974989307d6dc0f53e12a9962e4953cd57f6e7c413ebc81d057649", "ja": "事前に考えてきてくれるとは、さすがだな。\nそれで、何で迷ってるんだ？", "zh": "提前想好方案带过来，不愧是你。\n所以，你在纠结什么？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_027say0643_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_027say0643_1007_027say", "source_sha256": "b4e7f5653e5d75a0ca1672f84a083e5f56549c8067000f079022b0c823d55802", "ja": "ひとつは、悪魔らしく偉そうに誘惑するプランで……\nもうひとつは、元気に誘惑するプランです！", "zh": "一个是像恶魔一样傲慢地诱惑人的方案……\n另一个是精神十足地诱惑人的方案！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_027say0643_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_027say0643_1008_p", "source_sha256": "88db0ce90cf8d04c2db8a72bb265215a89093c02dd3094da01f1a8c36dc70b75", "ja": "なるほど、どっちもいいと思うけど……。\nせっかくなら、悪魔とたい焼きを合わせるのはどうだ？", "zh": "原来如此，我觉得两个方案都不错……不过既然难得，不如把恶魔和鲷鱼烧结合起来怎么样？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_027say0643_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_027say0643_1009_027say", "source_sha256": "f5a6b1c3e28d00f311cc9bf879d19c8f55833f3887795084e8d2f4638b8474dd", "ja": "悪魔とたい焼きを、合わせる……？", "zh": "把恶魔和鲷鱼烧结合起来……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_027say0643_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_027say0643_1010_p", "source_sha256": "969563ecb87de55d12a9a3d77e48f0aae357d003b16eabb305794282a5a16e86", "ja": "ああ。たい焼きは言わばスイーツ！\nその甘さに絡めて、優しく甘い囁きで誘惑するんだ！", "zh": "啊。鲷鱼烧可以说是甜点！\n就利用这份甜味，用温柔甜蜜的低语来诱惑她！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_027say0643_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_027say0643_1011_027say", "source_sha256": "5302c5bbd4ff732bcbd7dc89ace8ffc9ae1c1d57cf4daebf1098cb61daaa1d57", "ja": "なるほど……！　それならたい焼きのやさしい甘さを\n伝えられそうですし、いいアイディアかもしれません！", "zh": "原来如此……！这样的话，就能传达鲷鱼烧温柔的甜味了，或许是个不错的主意！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_027say0643_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_027say0643_1012_027say", "source_sha256": "a70c58998fec7999672500529c36a84e2a5a8f5f3a95e25fdd402a4c9002dcd9", "ja": "ありがとうございます、{$P$}！\n甘い囁きで誘惑するプラン、挑戦してみます！", "zh": "谢谢您，{$P$}！\n用甜蜜的私语去诱惑的方案，我来挑战一下试试！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_027say0643_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_027say0643_1013_027say", "source_sha256": "51161113e4d1df21ef8b31fc63b7e4accf624024a86fee957b7de8cc9dee88a4", "ja": "ただ、いきなりはちょっと恥ずかしいので……\n練習に付き合ってもらえますか……？", "zh": "不过，突然这样做还是有点害羞……\n可以陪我练习一下吗……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_027say0643_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_027say0643_1014_p", "source_sha256": "2f9fa7cec18070981be9c9137341c5fa727704c287442b85cb0625ab1b39f29c", "ja": "構わないよ。\nまずは紗代子がイメージした感じでやってみてほしい。", "zh": "没关系。先按纱代子想象的感觉试试看吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_027say0643_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_027say0643_1015_027say", "source_sha256": "7a526928fce210a3aa0094152ed44fd6e13e3dab6b6e42b24c72b299638ddcf6", "ja": "はい、わかりました！　えっと……\n「私と一緒に……あまーいたい焼き、食べちゃお♪」", "zh": "好的，我明白了！那个……\n“和我一起……吃掉甜甜的鲷鱼烧吧♪”", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_027say0643_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_027say0643_1016_p", "source_sha256": "b74eada740bda9b7fca0b56aac70e55b274f9355c5c9ad6c6523e562d9d5c9fc", "ja": "バッチリだと思うよ！　今の囁きを聞いたら、\nみんな誘惑に負けてしまうな。", "zh": "我觉得非常完美！听到刚才那番耳语，大家肯定都会抵挡不住诱惑的。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_027say0643_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_027say0643_1017_027say", "source_sha256": "e55de8f9375c9c8087b81cad1a1a886416532afbda15728bf9d38e4429360eb9", "ja": "本当ですか！？　よかった～。本番もこの調子で\nあまーく、たい焼きの魅力を伝えてきますね♪", "zh": "真的吗！？太好了～正式演出时我也会保持这个状态，甜甜地传达鲷鱼烧的魅力♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
